{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is on the edge: terrorist networks and dictatorships are tearing regions apart. In <strong>Meowcide: Kitties at War</strong>, you command the battle-hardened kitties of the <i>Meowrican</i> nation. Plan daring assaults, pull your comrades out of the fire, and claim victory against the odds. Face brutal firefights to the beats of adrenaline-fueled music, shocking twists, and a dark techno-thriller atmosphere \u2014 where you are just a single cog in someone\u2019s sinister master plan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>SURVIVE AND ADAPT</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330430/extras/e531a9eb70cf7ebabd2ec1b70d08064d.poster.avif?t=1759482061\" aria-label=\"Get ready\" width=740 height=126 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330430/extras/e531a9eb70cf7ebabd2ec1b70d08064d.webm?t=1759482061\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330430/extras/e531a9eb70cf7ebabd2ec1b70d08064d.mp4?t=1759482061\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In war, we win only by eliminating the enemy. Move fast, shoot straight. <strong>Meowcide</strong> is hardcore. Learn the rules and catch the vibe, and you\u2019ll be rewarded with the satisfying feel of pulling the trigger and punishing the bad guys (plus a pouch of catnip after RTB).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>ADAPT AND SURVIVE</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330430/extras/c75618d64e3575c1d50e7d3d65d77ee1.poster.avif?t=1759482061\" aria-label=\"Choose your kiutty\" width=740 height=126 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330430/extras/c75618d64e3575c1d50e7d3d65d77ee1.webm?t=1759482061\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330430/extras/c75618d64e3575c1d50e7d3d65d77ee1.mp4?t=1759482061\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Yankee Squad is yours to command! Decide who goes into battle. Assault Meowls, Gunner Schwarz, Sniper Fluffer, and Demolitionist Fishbone \u2014 four cats, four unique fates, four sets of deadly weapons. Different styles, one mission: spread democracy and take out the bad guys. Dig deeper, explore the combat zone, and collect intel to unlock new weapons and possibly recruit new squad members.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>STRIKE BACK AND WIN</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330430/extras/aabe6ab7f5e2f073422fa2e6d4c07e3a.poster.avif?t=1759482061\" aria-label=\"Enemy factions\" width=750 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330430/extras/aabe6ab7f5e2f073422fa2e6d4c07e3a.webm?t=1759482061\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Triumph in a world where enemy factions weave cunning conspiracies and their armies are strong and ruthless. Uncover a global crime, prevent the collapse of world order, and bring freedom to the oppressed animals of every nation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hardcore Top-Down Combat:</strong> fast, intense firefights where every mistake can be fatal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cats are Cute:</strong> yes, Corporal, I know you have paws. Fall in line!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactics Matter:</strong> plan strikes, rescue your squadmates, and win at great risk.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark Techno-Thriller World:</strong> a gripping story with unexpected twists and a tense atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pounding Soundtrack:</strong> 140 BPM is just the beginning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Global Conflict:</strong> fight terrorists and dictators across the world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3330430?t=1759482061","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3330430?t=1759482061","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330430/24e16a5c9a6ce3bbcf9b3e50b4339dcb415f1893/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759482061","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330430/24e16a5c9a6ce3bbcf9b3e50b4339dcb415f1893/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759482061","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains depictions of combat between anthropomorphic characters, including scenes with pixel blood when characters are hit. The storyline explores themes of geopolitical conflict in a fictional universe, including ideological clashes between different political systems. Additionally, the game includes occasional use of strong language, though it does not contain explicit profanity. There are no depictions of sexual acts, drug or alcohol abuse, or self-harm"},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is on the edge: terrorist networks and dictatorships are tearing regions apart. In <strong>Meowcide: Kitties at War</strong>, you command the battle-hardened kitties of the <i>Meowrican</i> nation. Plan daring assaults, pull your comrades out of the fire, and claim victory against the odds. Face brutal firefights to the beats of adrenaline-fueled music, shocking twists, and a dark techno-thriller atmosphere \u2014 where you are just a single cog in someone\u2019s sinister master plan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>SURVIVE AND ADAPT</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330430/extras/e531a9eb70cf7ebabd2ec1b70d08064d.poster.avif?t=1759482061\" aria-label=\"Get ready\" width=740 height=126 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330430/extras/e531a9eb70cf7ebabd2ec1b70d08064d.webm?t=1759482061\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330430/extras/e531a9eb70cf7ebabd2ec1b70d08064d.mp4?t=1759482061\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In war, we win only by eliminating the enemy. Move fast, shoot straight. <strong>Meowcide</strong> is hardcore. Learn the rules and catch the vibe, and you\u2019ll be rewarded with the satisfying feel of pulling the trigger and punishing the bad guys (plus a pouch of catnip after RTB).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>ADAPT AND SURVIVE</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai