t:</strong> fast, intense firefights where every mistake can be fatal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cats are Cute:</strong> yes, Corporal, I know you have paws. Fall in line!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactics Matter:</strong> plan strikes, rescue your squadmates, and win at great risk.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark Techno-Thriller World:</strong> a gripping story with unexpected twists and a tense atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pounding Soundtrack:</strong> 140 BPM is just the beginning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Global Conflict:</strong> fight terrorists and dictators across the world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Sacred Goat Game Firm"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330430/d4da6edd4d87498a41be1205050c3843ffcdd6a5/header.jpg?t=1759482061","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3330430/965463798/7aa7ba5265738420f56e215243dfe1e64235a3b6/1758467338/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759482060","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3330430/965463798/7aa7ba5265738420f56e215243dfe1e64235a3b6/1758467338/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759482060","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3330430/965463798/7aa7ba5265738420f56e215243dfe1e64235a3b6/1758467338/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759482060","id":257203361,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257203361/movie480.mp4?t=1759482060","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257203361/movie_max.mp4?t=1759482060"},"name":"Meowcide teaser","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257203361/6e537d106eb42601ba991e1ec46417ef5caebbe4/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1