th bloody firefights and a pounding soundtrack.","steam_appid":3330430,"support_info":{"email":"press@meowcide.com","url":"htpps://meowcide.com"},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong>, Russian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":"https://meowcide.com"}